Package: audioGenreR
Type: Package
Title: Music Genre Prediction Using PCA and k-Nearest Neighbours
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Name", email = "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to standardize audio files, extract acoustic
    features (RMS energy, zero-crossing rate, spectral features, MFCC, tempo),
    train a k-Nearest Neighbours classifier with PCA dimensionality reduction,
    and predict the music genre of new audio files.
